msgid ""
"Copter has a number of failsafe mechanisms to ease vehicle "
"recovery/prevent wandering in the event that vehicle control is lost. The"
" main failsafe topics are listed below."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-landing-page.rst:11
#: 4bd89916c14f44e7874f6dc8316def64
msgid ""
"Once a Radio Failsafe, Battery Failsafe, GCS Failsafe or Terrain Data "
"Loss Failsafe is entered and the failsafe action taken involves a mode "
"change to the vehicle, it remain in that mode until the pilot changes the"
" mode directly."
msgstr ""

